breaking_changes.Adaptation_method:
Explicitly add 'removeViewBox' to the plugins array in the SVGO configuration to retain previous behavior:

```js
export default {
  plugins: [
    'preset-default',
    'removeViewBox'
  ]
};
```

Explicitly add 'removeTitle' to the plugins array in the SVGO configuration to retain previous behavior:

```js
export default {
  plugins: [
    'preset-default',
    'removeTitle'
  ]
};
```

Update the plugin name from 'removeScriptElement' to 'removeScripts' in the SVGO configuration:

```js
export default {
  plugins: [
    'preset-default',
    'removeScripts'
  ]
};
```

Import helpers and plugins from the top-level 'svgo' module:

```js
// Before
import { querySelector, querySelectorAll } from 'svgo/lib/xast.js';
import { builtin } from 'svgo/lib/builtin';
import presetDefault from 'svgo/plugins/preset-default';

// After
import { querySelector, querySelectorAll } from 'svgo';
import { builtinPlugins } from 'svgo';
const presetDefault = builtinPlugins.find(plugin => plugin.name === 'preset-default');
```

Update the import path for the browser bundle:

```js
// Before
import { optimize } from 'svgo/dist/svgo.browser.js';

// After
import { optimize } from 'svgo/browser';
```

Pass a node-to-parent map using the `mapNodesToParents` helper when using hierarchical selectors:

```js
// Before
import { querySelectorAll } from 'svgo';
const nodes = querySelectorAll(childNode, selector);

// After
import { querySelectorAll, mapNodesToParents } from 'svgo';
const nodes = querySelectorAll(childNode, selector, mapNodesToParents(rootNode));
```

Use named imports instead of default imports:

```js
// Before
import svgo from 'svgo';
svgo.optimize('<svg></svg>');

// After (Option 1)
import { optimize } from 'svgo';
optimize('<svg></svg>');

// After (Option 2)
import * as svgo from 'svgo';
svgo.optimize('<svg></svg>');
```
